 une année de préfiguration pour lancer le projet Hermitage en 2018. Les défis sont nombreux, développement de la dynamique associative, définition d'un modèle économique solide, recherche de partenaires, autant de challenges pour pérenniser le projet.</p>\n","photos":[{"ID":147,"id":147,"title":"WhatsApp Image 2024-12-19 à 10.32.23_eabc1031","filename":"WhatsApp-Image-2024-12-19-a-10.32.23_eabc1031.jpg","filesize":224602,"url":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/WhatsApp-Image-2024-12-19-a-10.32.23_eabc1031.jpg","link":"https://wp-asso.com/hebergement/les-cabanes/whatsapp-image-2024-12-19-a-10-32-23_eabc1031/","alt":"","author":"1","description":"","caption":"","name":"whatsapp-image-2024-12-19-a-10-32-23_eabc1031","status":"inherit","uploaded_to":142,"date":"2025-10-27 02:34:27","modified":"2025-10-27 02:34:27","menu_order":0,"mime_type":"image/jpeg","type":"image","subtype":"jpeg","icon":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-includes/images/media/default.png","width":900,"height":1600,"sizes":{"thumbnail":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/WhatsApp-Image-2024-12-19-a-10.32.23_eabc1031-150x150.jpg","thumbnail-width":150,"thumbnail-height":150,"medium":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/WhatsApp-Image-2024-12-19-a-10.32.23_eabc1031-169x300.jpg","medium-width":169,"medium-height":300,"medium_large":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/WhatsApp-Image-2024-12-19-a-10.32.23_eabc1031-768x1365.jpg","medium_large-width":640,"medium_large-height":1138,"large":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/WhatsApp-Image-2024-12-19-a-10.32.23_eabc1031-576x1024.jpg","large-width":576,"large-height":1024,"1536x1536":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/WhatsApp-Image-2024-12-19-a-10.32.23_eabc1031-864x1536.jpg","1536x1536-width":864,"1536x1536-height":1536,"2048x2048":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/WhatsApp-Image-2024-12-19-a-10.32.23_eabc1031.jpg","2048x2048-width":900,"2048x2048-height":1600}},{"ID":146,"id":14