 ou les chevaux<br />\n– Débrief avec Claire Marine</p>\n<p><strong>Tous les jours sauf mercredi après-midi</strong><br />\n<strong>De 6 à 20 personnes</strong><br />\n<strong>2 fois 1h30</strong><br />\n<strong>Tarif : 450€ HT</strong></p>\n"},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/activite/174","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/activite"}],"about":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/types/activite"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/media/175"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=174"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-json/wp/v2/categories?post=174"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https://api.w.org/{rel}","templated":true}]},"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"id":175,"date":"2025-10-27T08:08:22","slug":"body-condition-scoring-your-horse-why-and-how-1024x683-1","type":"attachment","link":"https://wp-asso.com/activite/equicoaching/body-condition-scoring-your-horse-why-and-how-1024x683-1/","title":{"rendered":"body-condition-scoring-your-horse-why-and-how-1024×683-1"},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"acf":[],"caption":{"rendered":""},"alt_text":"","media_type":"image","mime_type":"image/webp","media_details":{"width":1024,"height":683,"file":"2025/10/body-condition-scoring-your-horse-why-and-how-1024x683-1.webp","filesize":194218,"sizes":{"medium":{"file":"body-condition-scoring-your-horse-why-and-how-1024x683-1-300x200.webp","width":300,"height":200,"filesize":22192,"mime_type":"image/webp","source_url":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/body-condition-scoring-your-horse-why-and-how-1024x683-1-300x200.webp"},"thumbnail":{"file":"body-condition-scoring-your-horse-why-and-how-1024x683-1-150x150.webp","width":150,"height":150,"filesize":8784,"mime_type":"image/webp","source_url":"https://wp-asso.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/body-condit